class = "runtime-risk"
severity = "medium"
observed = "Both token-transfer amount filter stages guard their two-bound clauses with from < to before calling Decimal.lt?. Decimal structs are compared by Erlang term order in that guard; equivalent numeric formats can change clause selection. For example lower bound 2.0 and upper bound 10 can fall through to the upper-only clause, discarding the lower bound."
