proposal = "In services/explorer/backend/apps/explorer/lib/explorer/chain/advanced_filter.ex, remove struct-order guards and validate both bounds with Decimal comparison in the function body. Exercise mixed scales, equal bounds and reversed numeric bounds in both pre- and post-unnesting stages."
